WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.881
[singing] Oh, the shameless
witch is dancing.

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:12.595
[singing] Oh, the shameful
fairy lies and gossips.

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.561
CUSTARD: Erica...?

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:23.815
You haven't ever wished
a family would adopt you,

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.525
have you?

00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:27.277
Nope.

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:31.406
EARWIG: Anybody who’d choose me
would be pretty unusual...

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:31.823
[gasps]

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:34.784
We'll take this one.

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:35.535
What?

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:38.663
EARWIG: For the first time in my life,
I’m being made to do something

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:39.789
I don’t want to do.

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:44.836
Now then let's you and I
get a few things straight.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:48.673
My name is Bella Yaga, I'm a witch.

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:49.841
Great!

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:55.305
You agree that you'll teach me magic,
and I agree to help you out!

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.933
BELLA YAGA: If you work really hard,
I shan't do anything to hurt you.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:00.518
[gasps]

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.937
EARWIG: A Love Potion
for the Boy Next Door?

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:05.523
All of these are pretty useless to me.

00:01:05.523 --> 00:01:05.857
[grunts]

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:09.527
The spell I believe you're looking for
is somewhere towards the back...

00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:11.738
Hang on. You actually talk!?

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.074
Of course I do, just not very often.

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:19.746
In this household...
there's one rule that's crucial.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:22.791
BELLA YAGA: You must
on no account for any reason,

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:25.794
ever dare disturb The Mandrake.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:27.754
Don't be rude.

00:01:28.546 --> 00:01:32.675
[singing] Don't disturb me,
I'm here to say,

00:01:32.675 --> 00:01:33.134
Huh?

00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:34.094
EARWIG: Earwig?

00:01:34.135 --> 00:01:38.014
THE MANDRAKE: A hole left by a witch
can only be filled by a witch.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:49.818
I'll be learning magic, or so I was told.
Can't wait to start!

